wb-dauerhaft-pro (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Exit with 7 when no devices are configured, after clearing the config-error report
  * Wait for an unavailable MQTT broker instead of exiting with 1; create the devices
    only after the first CONNACK; exit with 2 when the broker rejects the login
  * Exit with 0 on SIGINT/SIGTERM; report when the retained topics cannot be removed
    because the broker is not connected
  * Reject a broker URL the MQTT client cannot use as an argument error (exit 2) instead of crashing with 1
  * Require python3-wb-common >= 2.4.0 (MQTT client retry/wait API)

 -- Ekaterina Volkova <ekaterina.volkova@wirenboard.com>  Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:38:39 +0000

